menu "RoboHub DS18B20 waterproof probe"

config RH_BOARD_DS18B20_WATERPROOF_PROBE
    bool "DS18B20 waterproof temperature probe"
    select RH_DRV_DS18B20
    default n
    help
      A sealed DS18B20 temperature probe on a one-metre cable, for water,
      soil and ambient temperature. Selecting it brings in the driver and the
      1-Wire bus and timer the probe needs; an application that does not fit
      the probe pays for none of it.

endmenu
